### 1. Cadastrar Cliente (Público)
POST http://localhost:3000/cliente
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Carlos",
    "email": "carlos@gmail.com",
    "senha": "123",
    "cpf": "12345678901",
    "telefone": 48999998888
}

###

### 2. Cadastrar Cliente 2 (Público)
POST http://localhost:3000/cliente
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Ana",
    "email": "ana@gmail.com",
    "senha": "123",
    "cpf": "22233344455",
    "telefone": 48988887777
}

###

###  Fazer Login com carlos 
# @name loginReq
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "carlos@gmail.com",
    "senha": "123"
}

### 3. Cadastrar Cliente com dados incompletos
# Deve retornar erro se o banco exigir os campos obrigatórios
POST http://localhost:3000/cliente
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Cliente Incompleto",
    "email": "incompleto@gmail.com"
}

###

### listar clientes
GET  http://localhost:3000/clientes
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

###

### Consultar Ciclista por ID (Privado)
GET http://localhost:3000/cliente/1
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 4. Listar Clientes (Rota protegida)
GET http://localhost:3000/clientes
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

###

### 5. Cadastrar Console 1 (Rota protegida)
POST http://localhost:3000/console
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "modelo": "PlayStation 5",
    "marca": "Sony",
    "numeroSerie": "PS5-0001",
    "tipoServico": "Limpeza interna",
    "idCliente": 1
}

###

### 6. Cadastrar Console 2 (Rota protegida)
POST http://localhost:3000/console
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "modelo": "Xbox Series X",
    "marca": "Microsoft",
    "numeroSerie": "XBX-0002",
    "tipoServico": "Troca de pasta térmica",
    "idCliente": 2
}

###

### 7. Cadastrar Console com campos faltando
# Deve retornar erro de validação do banco
POST http://localhost:3000/console
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "modelo": "Nintendo Switch",
    "marca": "Nintendo"
}

###

### 8. Cadastrar Agendamento 1 (Cliente 1)
POST http://localhost:3000/agendamento
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "data": "2026-11-10",
    "hora": "14:30:00",
    "idCliente": 1,
    "idConsole": 1
}

###

### 9. Cadastrar Agendamento 2 (Cliente 2)
POST http://localhost:3000/agendamento
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "data": "2026-11-12",
    "hora": "10:00:00",
    "idCliente": 2,
    "idConsole": 2
}

###

### 10. Cadastrar Agendamento com console inexistente
# Deve retornar erro se a chave estrangeira for validada pelo banco
POST http://localhost:3000/agendamento
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "data": "2026-11-15",
    "hora": "16:00:00",
    "idCliente": 1,
    "idConsole": 999
}

###

### 11. Cadastrar Agendamento com campos faltando
POST http://localhost:3000/agendamento
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "data": "2026-11-20",
    "hora": "09:00:00"
}

